      "text": {
        "jp": "いいな！　歌がきっかけで故郷を思い出せるかもな。\r\nさっそく歌ってみてくれ。",
        "official_en": "Say, that sounds like an idea. Maybe you can remember something about your world by singing. Come on, let’s hear a song.",
        "real_en": null
      },
