      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "えっ！？　それは心の準備が……。\r\n練習しておくから、歌は次の機会にしてくれよ。",
        "official_en": "Huh!? I...I’m not quite sure I’m ready for my singing debut... I’ll need to...er...practice first.",
        "real_en": "Huh?! I'm not ready for that... I'll practice, so let me sing some other time."
      },
