      "text": {
        "jp": "こ、これは……\r\nよけいピンチに追い込まれた気がするぜ……？",
        "official_en": "Woe is me, for I’ve dug myself into a hole... A ditch most out of pitch...",
        "real_en": "Th-this... I feel like I've just put myself in an even worse spot..."
      },
