      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "鉄道にも乗ったが、\r\nあれは眺めがよくて、いい気分だったぜ。\r\n歌でも歌いたくなるってもんだ。",
        "official_en": "Ah yes, a large one at that. The views from the trains were splendid. Made me want to break into a tune.",
        "real_en": "I've ridden a train, too. The view was great! It made me feel like singing."
